sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Browser user
    participant D as DiffView.tsx
    participant M as MessageDiffBlock.tsx (lazy)
    participant API as FastAPI timeline.py
    participant DE as diff.py (pure-logic)
    participant TS as TraceStore
    participant DB as SQLite (rewind.db)

    Note over U,DB: Phase 5 two-branch diff: pick two branches → span_diff renders → expand a row → message_diff renders.

    Note over U,DB: Stage 1 user picks left and right via BranchTree ← / → buttons
    U->>D: ← on left-variant + → on right-variant
    D->>API: GET /api/v1/traces/{trace_id}/diff?left=...&right=...
    API->>API: validate UUIDs · check both branches exist via _branch_exists
    alt branch unknown
        API-->>D: 404 not found
        D-->>U: render banner--error "branch not found"
    else both exist
        API->>TS: get_spans(trace_id, branch_id=left) + get_spans(..., right)
        TS->>DB: SELECT spans WHERE trace_id AND branch_id
        DB-->>TS: left_rows right_rows
        TS-->>API: Spans lists (each ordered by started_at)
        API->>DE: span_diff(left_spans, right_spans)
        Note right of DE: zip-equal-window — _spans_equal compares<br/>name+kind+model+status+content_hash.<br/>First unequal pair → first_divergence_index.
        DE-->>API: SpanDiff(pairs=[SpanPair(status, ...)], first_divergence_index)
        API-->>D: 200 SpanDiffView JSON
        D-->>U: render DiffSummary + one DiffRow per pair<br/>(branch-point marker on first divergence)
    end

    Note over U,DB: Stage 2 user expands a row for token-level message diff (lazy)
    U->>D: click "msg diff" on a pair row
    D->>M: render MessageDiffBlock(left_rewind_id, right_rewind_id)
    M->>API: GET /api/v1/spans/{left_rewind_id}/message-diff?other={right_rewind_id}
    API->>TS: get both span rows by rewind_id
    TS->>DB: SELECT raw_attributes WHERE span key
    DB-->>TS: rows
    TS-->>API: span pair with extracted text via _extract_choice_content
    API->>DE: message_diff(left_text, right_text)
    Note right of DE: _tokenise keeps whitespace separate,<br>_is_word_token guards punctuation,<br>_coalesce_changed merges isolated <>+/- into a single <>+/- fragment.
    DE-->>API: MessageDiff(fragments=[MessageFragment(op="equal"|"insert"|"delete"|"changed", text)])
    API-->>M: 200 MessageDiffView JSON
    M-->>U: render fragments as ins / del / changed-del-ins
    Note over U: button toggles to "hide msg diff" on next click
